//! cokacmux — TUI session browser for local coding agents.
//!
//! Layout:
//!   ┌────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────┐
//!   │ session list (filterable)  │ preview (summary render)    │
//!   │                            │                             │
//!   └────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────┘
//!   Esc/q/Ctrl+Q quit · ↑/↓ move · Ctrl+F search · v view · t title · c clone · Delete/d delete · r refresh

